WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.170
A small white handkerchief,
"Spotted with strawberries".

2
00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.050
A man gives it to a woman.

3
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.220
It falls.

4
00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:10.290
Another hand picks it
up, and passes it on.

5
00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:14.160
In Act 1 he swore, "My
life upon her faith!"

6
00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:18.080
At the end, he calls himself
one "that loved not wisely,

7
00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:19.580
but too well".

8
00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:21.800
Is he right about his own love?

9
00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:25.450
In this mission, you'll sort
the many kinds of love on stage,

10
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.800
from Iago's to Roderigo's.

11
00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:30.260
You'll hear how a love
grew out of stories,

12
00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:31.930
told before the Duke.

13
00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:36.260
And you'll follow the handkerchief,
from love token to "proof".

14
00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:39.580
Your mission: decide
whether he loved not wisely,

15
00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:40.750
but too well.
